{"content_kind":"narrative.field","definition":{"id":"night_watch","index_mapping_version":1,"metadata":{"chapter":4,"title":"Drift","title_ko":"표류"},"rows":[{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/night_watch/0","jump":null,"original_index":0,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":3,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":0,"source_file":"data/chapter4_dialogue.json","source_hash":"355cead07d937895d476c3f30ee8ba2f22d58abaf232bb17c4c4e4e1f3edab53","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":0,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"They returned to the trail. Elia moved half a beat behind her own rhythm, hiding the cost of the anchoring.","text_ko":"둘은 길로 돌아갔다. 엘리아는 자신의 리듬보다 반 박자 늦게 움직이며 앵커링의 대가를 숨겼다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/night_watch/1","jump":null,"original_index":1,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/resonance_drift_shelter_echo.png"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":3,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":1,"source_file":"data/chapter4_dialogue.json","source_hash":"355cead07d937895d476c3f30ee8ba2f22d58abaf232bb17c4c4e4e1f3edab53","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":1,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"Behind them, the wind stopped all at once. A pressure settled against the back of Arrel's neck. The empty trail seemed to be paying attention.","text_ko":"뒤에서 바람이 단숨에 멎었다. 아렐의 목덜미에 압박감이 내려앉았다. 빈 길이 그들을 지켜보는 듯했다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/night_watch/2","jump":null,"original_index":2,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_concern"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":3,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":2,"source_file":"data/chapter4_dialogue.json","source_hash":"355cead07d937895d476c3f30ee8ba2f22d58abaf232bb17c4c4e4e1f3edab53","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":2,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"What is it?","text_ko":"왜 그래?"}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/night_watch/3","jump":null,"original_index":3,"presentation":{"portrait":"arrel_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":3,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":3,"source_file":"data/chapter4_dialogue.json","source_hash":"355cead07d937895d476c3f30ee8ba2f22d58abaf232bb17c4c4e4e1f3edab53","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":3,"text":{"speaker":"Arrel","text":"Nothing.","text_ko":"아무것도 아니야."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/night_watch/4","jump":null,"original_index":4,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":3,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":4,"source_file":"data/chapter4_dialogue.json","source_hash":"355cead07d937895d476c3f30ee8ba2f22d58abaf232bb17c4c4e4e1f3edab53","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":4,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"They passed a dead loop animal frozen mid-run and did not slow.","text_ko":"둘은 달리던 자세로 굳어 죽은 루프 동물을 지나쳤고, 속도를 늦추지 않았다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/night_watch/5","jump":null,"original_index":5,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":3,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":5,"source_file":"data/chapter4_dialogue.json","source_hash":"355cead07d937895d476c3f30ee8ba2f22d58abaf232bb17c4c4e4e1f3edab53","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":5,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"At a shallow cave, Arrel ate dried meat, stale bread, and cold mineral water. He committed every texture and taste to memory.","text_ko":"얕은 동굴에서 아렐은 말린 고기와 묵은 빵, 차가운 광물 맛의 물을 먹었다. 그는 모든 질감과 맛을 의식적으로 기억에 새겼다."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/night_watch/6","jump":null,"original_index":6,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_concern"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":3,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":6,"source_file":"data/chapter4_dialogue.json","source_hash":"355cead07d937895d476c3f30ee8ba2f22d58abaf232bb17c4c4e4e1f3edab53","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":6,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"Tell me when the letters slide again. Don't wait.","text_ko":"글자가 다시 미끄러지면 바로 말해. 기다리지 말고."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/night_watch/7","jump":null,"original_index":7,"presentation":{"portrait":"arrel_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":3,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":7,"source_file":"data/chapter4_dialogue.json","source_hash":"355cead07d937895d476c3f30ee8ba2f22d58abaf232bb17c4c4e4e1f3edab53","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":7,"text":{"speaker":"Arrel","text":"I won't.","text_ko":"그러지 않을게."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/night_watch/8","jump":null,"original_index":8,"presentation":{"portrait":"elia_neutral"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":3,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":8,"source_file":"data/chapter4_dialogue.json","source_hash":"355cead07d937895d476c3f30ee8ba2f22d58abaf232bb17c4c4e4e1f3edab53","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":8,"text":{"speaker":"Elia","text":"Get some sleep. I'll take first watch.","text_ko":"좀 자. 첫 불침번은 내가 설게."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/night_watch/9","jump":null,"original_index":9,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":3,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":9,"source_file":"data/chapter4_dialogue.json","source_hash":"355cead07d937895d476c3f30ee8ba2f22d58abaf232bb17c4c4e4e1f3edab53","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":9,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"Sleep took him at once. Elia waited until his breathing evened, then touched her upper lip. Her fingers came back dark.","text_ko":"잠은 즉시 그를 데려갔다. 엘리아는 그의 숨이 고르게 될 때까지 기다린 뒤 윗입술을 만졌다. 손가락에 검은 피가 묻어났다."}}]},"dialect":"field","extractor_version":"memoria-narrative/1","schema_version":1,"semantic_sha256":"e4f0bac8d37ecf7b34c5349759e9475ce20304900d7a4c01fc87cfa532a6f6df","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949","sources":[{"path":"data/chapter4_dialogue.json","sha256_utf8_lf":"355cead07d937895d476c3f30ee8ba2f22d58abaf232bb17c4c4e4e1f3edab53"},{"path":"scripts/systems/dialogue_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"b6163afcadbee0ad9e799d17caa57e16b949a3bc2a3dbd418391aed929ccce4a"},{"path":"scripts/systems/scene_flow.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"733bdd697ceaa1a82976164be5455ac792f94b5ec2a6c02716a5492c1ae4930d"},{"path":"scripts/ui/vn_scene.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"8da6f03fa6ff1e9695f3fcb985a79eacf96d3b74f5f49e2489c831d9eccc26ce"},{"path":"scenes/main/vn_host.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"a5a6c2295916b494cff559760616d9734d05652e20f7e531f930984a71246275"},{"path":"scenes/maps/verdan_market.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"25ff88bad40722ccecc1f02b270201b6b0771031eec511592afbcab88ad94ce3"},{"path":"scripts/systems/memory_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"5551c4fe5541e5201541a4dcee835ae4ec8fc7404167a4fc81e547e3b0520938"},{"path":"scripts/utils/journey_oath.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"39610117fa7a7b357960a931b024a28b1a27068f5da5d3602d67829b7a3d2635"},{"path":"scripts/core/game_manager.gd","sha256_utf8_lf":"302846dfed4304f009b39a728812ac91484cfe6b858e235e661e84fa7fb9e6d1"}]}
